---
import { Mic, ShieldCheck, Calculator, Check, ArrowRight, Play, Volume2 } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section id="features" class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-[#071527] text-white border-t border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle ambient glow accents -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 -left-40 w-96 h-96 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgba(15,169,104,0.18)_0%,transparent_60%)] blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-1/3 -right-40 w-96 h-96 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgba(217,98,43,0.15)_0%,transparent_60%)] blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-16 lg:mb-20">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#26C281] uppercase backdrop-blur-md">
        Capacidades Claves
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white">
        Tres tecnologías que eliminan los dolores más costosos de tu restaurante
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#F4F5F7]/80">
        Diseñadas específicamente para el ritmo, la velocidad y la realidad bancaria de Venezuela.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Feature 1: Reconocimiento de Voz -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-[28px] border border-white/10 bg-[#091E36] p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#26C281]/40 transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-warp-emerald text-white shadow-md">
              <Mic class="h-6 w-6" />
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-[#0FA968]/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#26C281]">
              Audio a Comanda
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white">
            "Tus clientes ya no escriben, mandan audios. Precyza los entiende al instante."
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#F4F5F7]/75">
            Se acabaron los cajeros perdiendo 40 segundos escuchando notas de voz con música o ruido de la calle. El motor de IA procesa audios en segundos, extrae ingredientes y entiende notas complejas de cocina.
          </p>

          <!-- Interactive Mockup: WhatsApp Audio Player & Structured Extraction -->
          <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#071527] p-4 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 p-3">
              <div class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0FA968] text-white">
                <Play class="h-4 w-4 fill-current ml-0.5" />
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-white/60 mb-1">
                  <span>Nota de voz (0:18s)</span>
                  <span class="text-[#26C281] font-mono">1.2s transcribiendo</span>
                </div>
                <!-- Waveform mockup -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1 h-3">
                  <div class="w-1 bg-[#0FA968] h-2 rounded-full"></div>
                  <div class="w-1 bg-[#0FA968] h-3 rounded-full"></div>
                  <div class="w-1 bg-[#26C281] h-3.5 rounded-full"></div>
                  <div class="w-1 bg-[#26C281] h-2 rounded-full"></div>
                  <div class="w-1 bg-white/30 h-3 rounded-full"></div>
                  <div class="w-1 bg-white/30 h-1.5 rounded-full"></div>
                  <div class="w-1 bg-white/30 h-2.5 rounded-full"></div>
                  <div class="w-1 bg-white/30 h-3.5 rounded-full"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-xl bg-white/5 p-3 text-xs space-y-1.5 border border-white/5">
              <p class="text-white/50 text-[10px] uppercase font-semibold">Extracción estructurada:</p>
              <p class="text-[#26C281] font-medium">• 2x Hmb Especial (1 sin cebolla, papas rústicas)</p>
              <p class="text-white/80">• 1x Ración de Tequeños</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#26C281]">
          <span>Cero tiempo perdido escuchando audios</span>
          <Check class="h-4 w-4" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Blindaje Antifraude -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-[28px] border border-white/10 bg-[#091E36] p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#D9622B]/40 transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-warp-orange text-white shadow-md">
              <ShieldCheck class="h-6 w-6" />
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-[#D9622B]/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#E58051]">
              Cero Fraudes
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white">
            "Olvídate de las capturas editadas. Si el dinero no está en tu cuenta, la comida no sale."
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#F4F5F7]/75">
            El fraude con montajes de Photoshop y apps que simulan transferencias bancarias es una fuga diaria. Precyza no confía en imágenes: valida los fondos consultando directamente la API de tu banco.
          </p>

          <!-- Interactive Mockup: Anti-fraud Bank Inspector -->
          <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#071527] p-4 space-y-2.5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-white/10 text-xs">
              <span class="text-white/60">Inspección de Pago Móvil</span>
              <span class="rounded bg-[#0FA968]/20 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#26C281] font-bold">API CONECTADA</span>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs">
              <div class="flex justify-between text-white/70">
                <span>Referencia reportada:</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-white">948201</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-white/70">
                <span>Consulta bancaria:</span>
                <span class="text-[#26C281] font-medium">Banesco API ✓</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-white/70">
                <span>Monto confirmado:</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-white tabular-nums">1,140.00 Bs</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-lg bg-[#0FA968]/15 border border-[#0FA968]/30 p-2.5 text-[11px] text-[#26C281] flex items-center gap-2">
              <Check class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0" />
              <span>Abono real verificado en 1.8 segundos.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#E58051]">
          <span>Protección absoluta contra capturas falsas</span>
          <Check class="h-4 w-4" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Conciliación Bancaria Automática -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between rounded-[28px] border border-white/10 bg-[#091E36] p-7 sm:p-8 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#0FA968]/40 transition-all duration-300">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#0B2545] text-white shadow-md border border-white/15">
              <Calculator class="h-6 w-6 text-[#26C281]" />
            </div>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white border border-white/10">
              Arqueo en 1 Clic
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-white">
            "El fin de las 2 horas de trasnocho cuadrando la caja al cierre."
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#F4F5F7]/75">
            Tu noche no debería terminar comparando comprobantes de WhatsApp contra el estado de cuenta y el POS. Cada bolívar y dólar queda vinculado a su referencia bancaria unívoca en tu sistema contable.
          </p>

          <!-- Interactive Mockup: One-Click Cashier Shift Reconciliation -->
          <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#071527] p-4 space-y-2.5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-white/10 text-xs">
              <span class="text-white/60">Arqueo de Turno · Cierre Diario</span>
              <span class="text-[#26C281] font-mono text-[10px]">11:30 PM</span>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1.5 text-xs font-mono">
              <div class="flex justify-between text-white/70">
                <span>Ventas WhatsApp:</span>
                <span class="text-white tabular-nums">$380.00 (15,200 Bs)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-white/70">
                <span>Validado en Banco:</span>
                <span class="text-white tabular-nums">15,200.00 Bs</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between pt-1 border-t border-white/10 font-bold">
                <span class="text-white">Diferencia de Caja:</span>
                <span class="text-[#26C281]">±0.00 Bs (Exacto)</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-2.5 text-[11px] text-white/80 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span>Reporte para el contador:</span>
              <span class="text-[#26C281] font-semibold">Listo en 1 Clic</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#26C281]">
          <span>Cero descuadres entre chat, banco y caja</span>
          <Check class="h-4 w-4" />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
